  {
   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»titan«",
   "text": "<p>适用于刀具制造商和磨削企业的通用高端测量机</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a></p>",
   "img": {
